> But, when I exit mpc8bug95 and disconnect the ADI ribbon cable from the
> FADS and toggle the power on the FADS; about all I get is the RUN, 5V,
> SDRAM, DRAM, and FLASH leds on.  No toggling AUX; nothing else for
